\b\fs30 Proof of concept, legal structure, market entry, business model, financial viability, and brutal founder verdict\b0\fs24\par
\par
Prepared: May 8, 2026  \par
Prepared for: Founder review  \par
Scope: India-first launch strategy for SehatSaathi as a report-understanding, follow-up continuity, lab intake, and retest-intelligence product\par
