\b\fs30 7. How to enter without making labs, doctors, or patients insecure\b0\fs24\par
\par
This is critical. Healthcare buyers become defensive quickly if they think software is trying to replace them, bypass them, or make them legally vulnerable.\par
\par
\b\fs26 7.1 Labs\b0\fs24\par
\par
Labs should not feel that you are trying to become a diagnosis engine on top of their result.\par
\par
The safe pitch:\par
\par
“We do not reinterpret your lab as a medical diagnosis. We turn the report into a calmer follow-up layer that helps the patient understand what to review and what to prepare.”\par
\par
What labs want to hear:\par
\par
\tab\bullet\tab we reduce patient confusion\par
\tab\bullet\tab we improve the digital experience\par
\tab\bullet\tab we encourage continuity\par
\tab\bullet\tab we support repeat engagement\par
\tab\bullet\tab we can sit inside your workflow\par
\par
What they do not want to hear:\par
\par
\tab\bullet\tab we tell the patient what disease they have\par
\tab\bullet\tab we redirect their authority\par
\tab\bullet\tab we create medico-legal exposure\par
\par
\b\fs26 7.2 Doctors\b0\fs24\par
\par
Doctors should not feel that SehatSaathi is becoming a parallel doctor.\par
\par
The safe pitch:\par
\par
“This is pre-review organization, not medical replacement. It reduces noise and prepares the patient better.”\par
\par
What doctors want:\par
\par
\tab\bullet\tab better prepared patients\par
\tab\bullet\tab fewer confused follow-up conversations\par
\tab\bullet\tab cleaner historical summaries\par
\tab\bullet\tab easier triage before consult\par
\par
What they fear:\par
\par
\tab\bullet\tab diagnostic substitution\par
\tab\bullet\tab patient panic\par
\tab\bullet\tab AI advice becoming clinical advice\par
\par
\b\fs26 7.3 Patients\b0\fs24\par
\par
Patients should not feel:\par
\par
\tab\bullet\tab judged\par
\tab\bullet\tab scared\par
\tab\bullet\tab overloaded\par
\tab\bullet\tab sold to\par
\par
They should feel:\par
\par
\tab\bullet\tab guided\par
\tab\bullet\tab calmer\par
\tab\bullet\tab prepared\par
\tab\bullet\tab held\par
\par
That emotional layer is not cosmetic. It is core trust infrastructure.\par
\par
