\par
They usually focus on:\par
\par
\tab\bullet\tab server\par
\tab\bullet\tab APIs\par
\tab\bullet\tab OCR\par
\par
But real health-tech burn often comes from:\par
\par
\tab\bullet\tab implementation support\par
\tab\bullet\tab partner education\par
\tab\bullet\tab sales cycle\par
\tab\bullet\tab fixing messy edge cases\par
\tab\bullet\tab trust and compliance work\par
