\b\fs26 29.4 Current stack economics advantage\b0\fs24\par
\par
The strongest thing in your favor financially is that your current architecture is not LLM-bloated for every report.\par
\par
That means:\par
\par
\tab\bullet\tab gross margin can stay healthier\par
\tab\bullet\tab cost per report can remain controlled\par
\tab\bullet\tab AI can be added selectively instead of compulsively\par
\par
This is a big strategic advantage over startups that call an expensive model on every interaction without strong need.\par
